      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m torn on using this to hid the magic number. Like Pipeline::kNumUniformBuffers is just saying the max number of UBO slots a pipeline could have. I know that is what must be the case here and you have the asserts above, but something seems slightly off using that value here.\n\nLike say we end up with wanting 3 UBOs in the future. In the case we have 2 UBOs there we would have something inline like `static constexpr size_t numUniformBuffers \u003d 2;` But then for the case of 3 you use the max size on the pipeline again?\n\nNot going to force any changes here if others are okay with this, but it just seems like using a value that has slightly different meaning but happens to match what we want.",
